## Scenarios

### specialized template context contract

#### routes six-argument context calls through the default wrapper

- Verify: routes six-argument context calls through the default wrapper
   - Expected: write_template_fixture(fixture) is true
   - Expected: rc equals `0`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 10 lines folded for reproduction.
